<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH AUG JOBLESS RATE RISES TO 3.1 PCT (3.0 PCT).</title>
<headline>CZECH AUG JOBLESS RATE RISES TO 3.1 PCT (3.0 PCT).</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in the Czech Republic in August was 162,978, or 3.1 percent of the workforce, up from 3.0 percent in July, the Ministry of Labour and Social Affairs said on Friday.  </p>
<p> CZECH UNEMPLOYMENT     AUG 1996    JULY 1996    AUG 1995</p>
<p>  number of jobless	162,978     158,252     155,324</p>
<p>  pct of workforce	   3.1	   3.0	   3.0</p>
<p>-- Prague Newwsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
